ular redirection is for same AMF, not for reallocation Nokia: can be for another AMF ZTE: reusing current procedure we have Cl1+Cl2 and repurpose (in SA2 spec if no init UE ctxt, then the existing message cannot be sent) Nokia: not an issue SLICE NOT SUPPORTED R3-182627 TS38.423 pCR on Slice not supported Type: pCR For: (not specified) 38.423 v0.8.0 Source: ZTE Abstract: pCR, Rel-15,NR_newRAT Discussion: Ericsson: over Xn, source is aware that target does not support some slices, yet it triggered a HO -> if PDU session fails, its obvious (different from AMF<->RAN case) Decision: The document was noted.

